              "description": "Emails that inform the candidate their application will not be moving forward, has been rejected, or the position has been filled by someone else. Test: Does the email contain a clear negative decision — \"unfortunately,\" \"will not be moving forward,\" \"pursuing other candidates,\" \"position has been filled\"? If yes → Refused."
            },
            {
              "category": "Received",
              "description": "Emails that only acknowledge the application was submitted/received, with no decision yet — a neutral holding message. Test: Does the email simply confirm receipt (\"thank you for applying,\" \"we have received your application,\" \"we will review and get back to you\") with no decision or next step mentioned? If yes → Received."
